.vscode/

### Mac OS ###
.DS_Store
### Player-owned settings, written at runtime ###
# Chosen on the machine they are on: which renderer, which keys. Copyable
# between machines by hand (that is the point of them being plain files), but
# not part of the source tree.
/src/main/resources/config/render.json
/src/main/resources/config/keybinds.json
# The player's own settings and their save files: like the key binds above,
# these belong to whoever is running this copy of the game, not to the repo.
/src/main/resources/config/player.json
/src/main/resources/saves/
__pycache__/
